# Context for `docker build -f frontend/Dockerfile frontend`. Excluding
# node_modules matters beyond speed: this repo's local node_modules holds
# macOS-native binaries (e.g. lightningcss); if `COPY . .` picked those up
# before `npm ci` reinstalls Linux-native ones, the container build breaks.
node_modules/
.next/
.git/
npm-debug.log*
# Mirrors the root .dockerignore's care around .env: a future
# frontend/.env.local (real API keys, local overrides) must never ride
# along in `COPY . .` and end up baked into the image.
.env*
